  "text": "Skip to main content\nMEMBERSHIP\n \nINSURANCE\n \nAUTOMOTIVE\n \nMARKETPLACE\n \nIMPACT\nLogin\nSearch\nMenu\nCar Insurance Made Easy\n\nSimply give us a call, visit us in-person or renew online if you’re eligible.\n\nRENEW ICBC\nWear the wildflower that defends against wildfires\n\nThe BCAA Fireweed Pin celebrates our strength in the face of wildfires. Get yours today and help support wildfire resilience efforts across BC.\n\nLEARN MORE\nManage your products in one place\n\nEverything you need is at your fingertips. Manage a renewal, find your documents, download a digital wallet card or start a claim in myBCAA.\n\nLOGIN\nJoin BC’s online community, BCAA Connect!\n\nSwap tips, ask questions and connect with others in your trusted space to share life in BC.\n\nSIGN IN\nLet's GO!\n\nA BCAA GO Membership is your ticket to unlocking sweet perks to help you make the most of life in BC. Save over $1,000/year on the everyday, Evo & more!\n\nSIGN UP\nNEED ROADSIDE ASSISTANCE?\nI would like to:\nJoin BCAA\nRenew\nBuy Travel Insurance\nBuy Home Insurance\nRenew ICBC\nBook Auto Repair\nBook an Appointment\nSmall Business Quote\nMoving British Columbians Forward​\n\nFrom help at home to on the move, we keep British Columbians moving forward with proven protection and mobility solutions, including Membership, Insurance, Auto Service and Evo. Plus, as a BCAA Member, you can save over $1,500 a year on everyday essentials, insurance, experiences, travel, dining out and more! That’s the power of BCAA, and it’s moving British Columbians forward. Join the movement today!\n\nMEMBERSHIP\nPROTECTION AND SAVINGS\n\nAlways ready to save the day and money for our Members.\n\nLEARN MORE\nINSURANCE\nLOCAL KNOWLEDGE AND EXPERT ADVICE\n\nProviding best in class protection while helping our Members save money.\n\nLEARN MORE\nAUTOMOTIVE\nKEEPING YOU ON THE ROAD\n\nFrom Auto Service to Shared Mobility you can count on us\n\nLEARN MORE\nWays to save\n\nAs a BCAA Member, you can save up to 30% at hundreds of your favourite brands worldwide and earn up to 10% in CAA Dollars®. Explore all our savings partners and find the latest exclusive deals.\n\nBCAA Insurance\nLEARN MORE\nBCAA Insurance\n\nBCAA Members save up to 20% on Award Winning Home, Optional Car, Travel, Small Business and Life Insurance.\n\nLEARN MORE\nShell\n\nSave 3¢/L on fuel and 10% on car washes & in-store purchases. BCAA Members can save over $138 per year!\n\nLEARN MORE\nEvo & Evo Extras​\n\nGet a FREE Evo Membership, 60 FREE driving minutes, & save 10% on every trip – up to $110/year! Plus, get access to exclusive perks with Evo Extras.\n\nLEARN MORE\nRogers\n\nSave up to $25/month on Rogers 5G+ mobile plans - that's up to $300 in savings per year!\n\nSEE MORE WAYS TO SAVE\nBecome a BCAA Member today.\nJOIN ONLINE\nBCAA Blog\n\nOffering expert advice, useful articles, inspiring stories and simple tips to help you navigate life’s many roads.\n\n Membership\nHow to maximize your BC summer road trip (and save on the way)\nREAD MORE\n Travel\nSix tips when you protect your trip with Travel Insurance\nREAD MORE\n Community\nNew to British Columbia? Join a welcoming community on BCAA Connect\nREAD MORE\nVIEW MORE ARTICLES\nMEMBERSHIP\nINSURANCE\nAUTOMOTIVE\nIMPACT\n \n BCAA CONNECT\n BCAA BLOG\n TRIP PLANNING\n NEW TO CANADA\n MEDIA CENTRE\n CAREERS\n ABOUT BCAA\n CONTACT US\n FAQS\n JOIN EMAIL LIST\nFIND A BCAA LOCATION\nSERVICE LOCATIONS\nAUTO SERVICE CENTRES\nFollow BCAA\n\nBCAA respectfully acknowledges that we operate and support Members and customers on the ancestral, unceded territories of Indigenous communities across what is known today as BC. BCAA is headquartered on the lands of the hən̓q̓əmin̓əm̓ and Sḵwx̱ wú7mesh speaking peoples, known today as the City of Burnaby.\n\n \n\nInsurance is sold through B.C.A.A. Holdings Ltd. dba BCAA Insurance Agency, a licensed insurance agent, and underwritten by various underwriters. Visit bcaa.com/underwriters.\n\n \n\nBCAA (The British Columbia Automobile Association) is a member of the Canadian Automobile Association (CAA) and the American Automobile Association (AAA), serving Members in British Columbia and the Yukon. Call 1-888-268-2222\n\n \n\nTerms | Privacy  © 2026 BCAA",
